---
import { DEFAULT_LISTS, WORKFLOW_STEPS } from '@lib/features/issue-tracking';
import Keyed from './Keyed.astro';
---

<section class="border-t border-line" aria-labelledby="thread-title">
  <div class="wrap py-16 md:py-24 grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-12">
    <div class="lg:col-span-5">
      <h2 id="thread-title" class="h2">
        From bug report to resolved issue, without losing the thread.
      </h2>
      <p class="prose mt-5 max-w-[46ch]">
        Six steps on <code>ACME-12</code>, each one recorded where the next person will look: on the issue, in its
        history, and in the inbox of whoever needs to know.
      </p>

      <h3 class="h3 mt-10">Your lists, no transition rules.</h3>
      <p class="prose mt-2 text-base max-w-[46ch]">
        Statuses, priorities and types are lists each project edits. Any status can follow any status. Each status
        belongs to a category, and a done or cancelled one marks the issue resolved.
      </p>
      <dl class="scopes mt-5">
        {DEFAULT_LISTS.map(item => (
          <>
            <dt>{item.list}</dt>
            <dd>{item.values}</dd>
          </>
        ))}
      </dl>
      <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-fg-3">
        What a new project starts with. A Project Admin adds, recolours and deletes values, and picks each list’s
        default.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ol class="lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7 rule-list it-steps">
      {WORKFLOW_STEPS.map(step => (
        <li class="py-6">
          <h3 class="h3">{step.title}</h3>
          <p class="prose mt-2 text-base">
            <Keyed text={step.body} />
          </p>
          <p class="quote mt-3">{step.record}</p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .it-steps {
    counter-reset: it-step;
  }
  .it-steps li {
    counter-increment: it-step;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 28px minmax(0, 1fr);
  }
  .it-steps li::before {
    content: counter(it-step);
    grid-row: 1 / span 3;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 24px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .it-steps li > * {
    grid-column: 2;
  }
</style>
